{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19116","headline":"尉迟郎中见示自南迁牵复却至洛城东旧居之作因以和之 · 刘禹锡","name":"尉迟郎中见示自南迁牵复却至洛城东旧居之作因以和之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾遭飞语十年谪，新受恩光万里还。\n朝服不妨游洛浦，郊园依旧看嵩山。\n竹含天籁清商乐，水遶庭台碧玉环。\n留作功成退身地，如今只是暂时闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}